{{also|tot|tót|tốt}}
==French==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fro|fr}} {{term|tost|lang=fro}}, from {{etyl|VL.|fr}} {{term||tostum|lang=la}}, from the neuter of {{etyl|la|fr}} {{term|tostus||toasted|lang=la}}, later meaning "hotly, promptly" in Vulgar Latin. Cognate to Italian {{term|tosto|lang=it}}, Catalan and Occitan {{term|tost|lang=ca}}, to Walloon {{term|toit|lang=wa}}.

